      "message": "`value \u0026\u003d ~GENMASK(7, 0) | ~GENMASK_ULL(51, 12)` parses as `value \u0026\u003d ~(GENMASK(7,0) \u0026 GENMASK(51,12))`, and those ranges are disjoint, so the mask is all-ones and clears nothing. Neither the Size field [7:0] nor the queue Physical_Address [51:12] is cleared before the hyp values are OR\u0027d in, so host address bits survive into the physical GITS_CBASER and can steer the command queue away from the sanitized shadow. Should be `value \u0026\u003d ~(GENMASK(7, 0) | GENMASK_ULL(51, 12));`",
